; Test reach with the two records exchanged
;
; Exchanges IX and IY, runs #R$9E40, and exchanges them back, so the caller can
; hold the object in IX and the observer in IY. #R$980E asks it whether the
; player (IY) can reach the NPC being run (IX); #R$A73B asks it for the small
; curious key.
;
; A Object id
; IX Record of the object
; IY Record of the observer
; O:F As #R$9E40: NZ when the object is within reach
@label=CanReachSwapped
c$9E25 CALL $9E2B
 $9E28 CALL $9E40       ; IX = observer, IY = object
@label=SwapIXIY
*$9E2B PUSH IX          ; falls through from above: swaps them back
 $9E2D PUSH IY
 $9E2F POP IX
 $9E31 POP IY
 $9E33 RET
